      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I've created a sigil that when used will "
        },
        {
          "text": "temporarily transfer the targeted ground into a pocket dimension",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". While there, the space is walkable as if mined. After about ten seconds, the materials will snap back into place as if nothing happened, provided nothing has fallen into its place. \n\nThis can trap unwitting creatures, and I'm sure me as well. I had best make sure I'm not in the way when it comes back. \n\nAlso, it only seems to affect basic terrain."
        }
      ]
    }
